ipt_desktop":"https://img.jkos.com.tw/official-site/handwrite_script_desktop_2.png","meta_og_image":"https://img.jkos.com.tw/official-site/Facebook_post.png","topBanner_btn_link":"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScvKczT-YLNQp1yxjIPyPMy8_KUjw9DR0T5onIYtJ6K0t4nEQ/viewform","module2_tab2_btnLink":"http://event.jkos.com.tw/promotions/A/jkosolution/20200515/index2.html","home-banner-title":"街口支付，不止支付","home-banner-subTitle":"電子支付聰明解鎖生活每一刻","home-banner-btn-text":"立即下載","home-learn-more-indicator":"了解全台最多人使用的電子支付","home-module1-signup-btnText":"立即瞭解如何註冊","home-module1-list1-title1":"出示或掃描條碼","home-module1-list1-title2":"即完成付款！","home-module1-list1-desc":"只要綁定銀行帳戶、信用卡或儲值街口帳戶，便可輕鬆使用掃碼付款","home-module1-list1-alt":"街口支付提供便利的掃碼付款服務","home-module1-list2-title1":"付款、載具、會員點數","home-module1-list2-title2":"通通一次搞定","home-module1-list2-desc":"載具及會員帳號全都在同一個付款碼上，結帳不必再出示多個條碼","home-module1-list2-alt":"街口支付付款碼可以綁定載具和各式會員","home-module1-list3-alt":"街口支付提供最安全的帳戶防護","home-module1-list3-title1":"帳戶安全防護","home-module1-list3-title2":"讓支付更安心","home-module1-list3-desc":"透過雙重驗證技術與嚴格的審查流程，確保您的帳戶安全","home-module1-list3-btnText":"了解更多","home-module2-title-line1":"無處不在，","home-module1-title-line1":"一掃即付，","home-module1-title-line2":"便利付款毫不費力","home-module2-title-line2":"天天都在用","home-module2-subTitle-line1":"你家巷口的便利商店、每天聽的音樂串流平台、愛逛的網購電商，","home-module2-subTitle-line2":"還有更多 30 萬間通路店鋪都能使用街口支付。","home-module2-btnText":"查看更多合作通路","home-module3-title-line1":"豐富生活盡在街口，","home-module3-title-line2":"支付開啟聰明捷徑","home-module3-subTitle-line1":"街口支付哪裡可以用？","home-module4-title-line1":"付款筆筆享回饋，","home-module4-title-line2":"精打細算就該這麼簡單","home-module4-subTitle-line1":"讓街口支付成為你的省錢神器，生活理財更省心","home-module4-btnText":"立即下載，查看好康優惠","home-module4-list1-title":"街口幣消費回饋，為下一筆支付聰明省錢","home-module4-list1-icon":"https://img.jkos.com.tw/official-site/jkocoin.svg","home-module4-list2-title":"街口券專屬優惠，好康折抵隨領即享","home-module4-list2-icon":"https://img.jkos.com.tw/official-site/coupon.svg","home-module4-list3-title":"各式熱門通路不定時超